source: crates/hpm-package/tests/native_package_snapshots.rs
expression: render(name)
---
--- Generic
file: deps.json
{
  "name": "deps",
  "hpath": "$HOUDINI_PACKAGE_PATH/deps",
  "load_package_once": true,
  "show": true,
  "enable": "houdini_version == '21.0'",
  "env": [
    {
      "PKG_DEPS": "$HOUDINI_PACKAGE_PATH/deps"
    }
  ],
  "recommends": [
    "rig",
    "tools"
  ],
  "hpackage": {
    "version": "1.0.0-beta.1"
  }
}
--- SideFxHpackage
error: houdini version requirement `=21.0` leaves SideFX's hpackage repository no bound it can read: it takes a package's Houdini version from `>=` and `<=` clauses only, and this range compiles to neither. Express the lower bound with `>=`.
